          "heading_path": [
            "Item 8 Financial Statements and Supplementary Data",
            "Stock-Based Compensation"
          ],
          "item": "8",
          "text": "For the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024, and 2025, total SBC expense was $22.1 billion, $22.8 billion, and $27.1 billion, including amounts associated with awards we expect to settle in Alphabet stock of $21.7 billion, $22.0 billion, and $24.1 billion, respectively.\n\nFor the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024, and 2025, we recognized tax benefits on total SBC expense, which are reflected in the provision for income taxes, of $4.5 billion, $4.6 billion, and $5.0 billion, respectively.\n\nFor the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024, and 2025, tax benefit realized related to awards vested or exercised during the period was $5.6 billion, $6.8 billion, and $8.1 billion, respectively. These amounts do not include the indirect effects of stock-based awards, which primarily relate to the research and development tax credit."
